BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Author Talk - Being Jewish: What it means to me
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260502T150000
UID:69e120b55c04bc0fc0628de2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Author Erin Silver presents her book\nI am Jewish\nto explore 
 the religion\, history and culture. Erin will share her personal experienc
 es. Participants will see just how much we all have in common. There will 
 also be a special craft activity.\nSpace is limited\, registration is requ
 ired.
LOCATION:Ethennonnhawahstihnen'
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69e120b55c04bc0fc0628de2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
