UID:69c58d22274a65e67a90d0c6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club work on a LEGO project\, make stuff\, meet other kids and ha
 ve fun! For ages\n[\n6-12].\nSnacks are offered during the After School Cl
