DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260420T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260420T170000
UID:69459169b5ff47300057314a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages\n6-12.\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for
  participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously s
 upported\, in part\, by donors.
LOCATION:Evelyn Gregory
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69459169b5ff47300057314a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
