DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260423T170000
UID:694968c6c967cb41207dfe09@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages 6-12.\nDrop-in. No registration required. Limited space ava
 ilable.\nProgram topics will be updated regularly.\nApr 2 - Make Your Own 
 Board Game\nApr 9 - Slime\nApr 16 - Paper Spinners\nApr 23 - Wind Mobiles\
 nApr 30 - Snap Circuits\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club f
 or participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously
  supported\, in part\, by donors.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 101
